First, perform the requested integration.

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\displaystyle\int\limits_{0}^{1}{f\left( x \right)dx}
\\\\
&=\displaystyle\int_0^1\sum_{n=0}^{\infty }\dfrac{n+1}{{{3}^{n+2}}}x^ndx
\\\\
&=\displaystyle\sum_{n=0}^{\infty }\int_0^1\dfrac{n+1}{{{3}^{n+2}}}x^ndx
\\\\
&=\displaystyle\left. \sum_{n=0}^{\infty }\dfrac{n+1}{{{3}^{n+2}}}\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1} \right|_{0}^{1}
\\\\
&=\displaystyle\sum_{n=0}^{\infty }{\dfrac{1}{{{3}^{n+2}}}}
\end{align}$
